  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "人工智慧入門與省思",
    "sub_ename": "REFLECTIONS ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
    "describe_ch": "人工智慧(AI)帶來的科技典範轉移，已是無法抵擋的潮流，因此認識AI乃至利用AI，便成為現代學生必需擁有的知能。本課程將介紹AI人工智慧的發展，釐清AI、機器學習(ML)與深度學習的異同，並介紹ML處理問題的流程步驟，引導同學以ML流程架構來解決生活乃至人類社會問題。同時以人文的角度，對AI所帶來的社會變遷進行省思。藉由TensorFlow的介紹與實作，同學將可更進一步了解ML，以及打好後續進階課程的基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "Paradigm shift driven by artificial intelligence (AI) has become an irresistible trend.  Therefore, understanding and using AI have become necessary knowledge for modern students.  This course introduces the development of AI and clarifies the differences among AI, machine learning (ML), and deep learning. It also introduces the processing steps of ML, and guides students to use ML to solve daily and social problems. Moreover, the course reflects on the social changes caused by AI from the humanistic perspective. Finally, via the implementation of TensorFlow, students will have a better understanding of ML and have the ability to select advanced courses.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解甚麼是AI人工智慧，並能區分AI、機器學習(ML)與深度學習的異同。",
      "describe_en": "Understand what the artificial intelligence (AI) is and be able to distinguish AI, machine learning (ML) and deep learning."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "了解ML處理問題的流程步驟，並學會以ML流程架構解決生活與人類社會問題。",
      "describe_en": "Understand the processing steps of ML, and be able to use ML to solve daily and social problems."
    }
  ],
